{
  "method": "recognizer_word_times",
  "cues": [
    {
      "id": "c1",
      "start": 0.66,
      "end": 3.39,
      "text": "A crash patient rolls into the nearest ER,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c2",
      "start": 3.43,
      "end": 6.26,
      "text": "and often there's no trauma surgeon on call.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c3",
      "start": 6.4,
      "end": 8.15,
      "text": "Often it's a Level Four center,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c4",
      "start": 8.19,
      "end": 10.7,
      "text": "a well equipped rural emergency room.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c5",
      "start": 10.84,
      "end": 12.84,
      "text": "The doctor there treats everything",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c6",
      "start": 12.88,
      "end": 15.02,
      "text": "from strokes to pediatric flu.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c7",
      "start": 15.21,
      "end": 17.06,
      "text": "Trauma is rarely her strength,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c8",
      "start": 17.1,
      "end": 19.56,
      "text": "because these towns don't see a lot of injury.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c9",
      "start": 20.0,
      "end": 22.44,
      "text": "First she has to decide to transfer.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c10",
      "start": 22.48,
      "end": 24.39,
      "text": "That decision alone takes",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c11",
      "start": 24.43,
      "end": 26.48,
      "text": "15 to 30 minutes today.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c12",
      "start": 27.1,
      "end": 30.81,
      "text": "Texas has 173 basic Level Four centers,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c13",
      "start": 30.85,
      "end": 33.26,
      "text": "and only 22 at Level One.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c14",
      "start": 33.68,
      "end": 36.06,
      "text": "Then she has to hospital shop by phone",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c15",
      "start": 36.1,
      "end": 37.09,
      "text": "for a trauma center",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c16",
      "start": 37.13,
      "end": 38.45,
      "text": "that will take the patient,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c17",
      "start": 38.49,
      "end": 39.9,
      "text": "and call an ambulance.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c18",
      "start": 40.38,
      "end": 42.72,
      "text": "After the yes comes the wait.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c19",
      "start": 43.02,
      "end": 44.78,
      "text": "State registry data show up",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c20",
      "start": 44.82,
      "end": 46.15,
      "text": "to 80 percent of the",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c21",
      "start": 46.19,
      "end": 48.01,
      "text": "most severely injured wait more",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c22",
      "start": 48.05,
      "end": 50.02,
      "text": "than two hours to be transferred.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c23",
      "start": 50.34,
      "end": 52.08,
      "text": "The stakes are high.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c24",
      "start": 52.32,
      "end": 54.03,
      "text": "Trauma is the leading cause of",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c25",
      "start": 54.07,
      "end": 56.36,
      "text": "death for people up to age 45.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c26",
      "start": 56.84,
      "end": 58.11,
      "text": "In San Antonio,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c27",
      "start": 58.15,
      "end": 60.06,
      "text": "trauma surgeon Brian Eastridge",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c28",
      "start": 60.1,
      "end": 61.11,
      "text": "spent much of his",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c29",
      "start": 61.15,
      "end": 64.02,
      "text": "career as an Army trauma surgeon in war zones.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c30",
      "start": 64.36,
      "end": 66.7,
      "text": "Now he co-leads iRemedyACT,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c31",
      "start": 66.94,
      "end": 70.26,
      "text": "a statewide team using AI on this delay.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c32",
      "start": 70.44,
      "end": 72.93,
      "text": "Their tool flags signs of severe",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c33",
      "start": 72.97,
      "end": 75.71,
      "text": "injury and prompts an earlier transfer call.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c34",
      "start": 75.75,
      "end": 76.99,
      "text": "It pushes the doctor",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c35",
      "start": 77.03,
      "end": 78.92,
      "text": "to make that decision sooner.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c36",
      "start": 79.3,
      "end": 80.25,
      "text": "With the tool,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c37",
      "start": 80.29,
      "end": 82.92,
      "text": "that decision could take five to 10 minutes.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c38",
      "start": 83.06,
      "end": 85.12,
      "text": "A faster decision still leaves",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c39",
      "start": 85.16,
      "end": 86.63,
      "text": "the calls and the ride.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c40",
      "start": 86.67,
      "end": 88.86,
      "text": "A survival benefit is something he suspects.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c41",
      "start": 89.22,
      "end": 92.02,
      "text": "He calls it just a tool, like an ultrasound.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c42",
      "start": 92.06,
      "end": 93.655,
      "text": "It sharpens the doctor's",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c43",
      "start": 93.695,
      "end": 95.7,
      "text": "judgment instead of replacing it.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c44",
      "start": 95.74,
      "end": 99.87,
      "text": "A UT System AI moonshot called BEACON plans to",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c45",
      "start": 99.91,
      "end": 101.23,
      "text": "test an AI assistant",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c46",
      "start": 101.27,
      "end": 103.6,
      "text": "at seven UT hospital sites.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c47",
      "start": 103.76,
      "end": 104.86,
      "text": "As of September,",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c48",
      "start": 104.9,
      "end": 107.0,
      "text": "a statewide pilot of the transfer",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c49",
      "start": 107.04,
      "end": 108.76,
      "text": "tool was planned for the fall.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c50",
      "start": 108.92,
      "end": 110.67,
      "text": "The call could come sooner.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    },
    {
      "id": "c51",
      "start": 110.71,
      "end": 112.64,
      "text": "The road is still the road.",
      "source": "recognizer_word_times"
    }
  ]
}
